      "writtenOn": "2023-10-18T12:01:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. As this internal structure is only communicated between the microdroid and RKP VM, the format can be flexible. It would be more convenient to directly serialize the struct using `ciborium/serde` instead of building with cbor directly.\nDeserializing from a CBOR array in this case would require lots of boilerplate code (see to the latest PS).\n\nIf the byte array size is a concern, we can import [serde_bytes](https://docs.rs/serde_bytes/latest/serde_bytes/) to make it more compact. That would also allow other `Vec\u003cu8\u003e` fields in the `requests` module to benefit from the bytes format.",
